<figure id="A1.F8" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.02228v1/plot_lnd_scaling_law_fit_gamma_func__expset_tokenparam_xaxis_token_param_ratio__huber_delta_0.00100.svg" id="A1.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/176;" width="548" height="176"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span>Comparison between the parametric fit with <math id="A1.F8.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma=1</annotation></semantics></math> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib35" title="" class="ltx_ref">Hoffmann et al., 2022</a>)</cite> and <math id="A1.F8.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma</annotation></semantics></math> as free parameter <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib19" title="" class="ltx_ref">Busbridge et al., 2025</a>)</cite>. Including <math id="A1.F8.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma</annotation></semantics></math> as fit parameter improves the fit quality.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Power-Law Exponents in Over-Training</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Tab. <a href="#A1.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ A.3 Power-Law Exponents in Over-Training ‣ Appendix A Extended Training Scaling Behavior ‣ xLSTM Scaling Laws: Competitive Performance with Linear Time-Complexity" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> we report the power-law exponents for different token-to-parameter ratios.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Power-law exponents <math id="A1.T3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>η</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta</annotation></semantics></math> for increasing token-to-parameter ratios <math id="A1.T3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math>. </figcaption>
<table id="A1.T3.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.T3.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T3.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><math id="A1.T3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T3.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_tt">Transformer</td>
