<figure id="A3.T8" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span> <span id="A3.T8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">FLOP counts</span> for the <span id="A3.T8.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">chunkwise-parallel mLSTM formulation</span> for mLSTM.
All terms denote the FLOP count per head and chunk.</figcaption>
